<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia May industrial output down 2.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia May industrial output down 2.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday:</p>
<p>SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT</p>
<p>				    May   April  May 96</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (pct)   -6.4    +5.6   +0.6</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)     -2.9    +4.3   -0.5</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
